  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the regional Action Plan for Latin America &amp; Caribbean (2021-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will contribute to the improvement of the state of conservation at World Heritage properties (especially at WH sites in danger and/or in case of conflict and post-conflict situations) and to support States Parties in the Region in the implementation of the Regional Action Plan for the LAC Region (2023-2029). Through capacity-building and advice, this activity will enhance inclusive and gender-balanced management, with the involvement of communities - including Indigenous peoples.</narrative>
  </description>
